### Catalog with stock
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products

### Standard order: approved automatically by the decision table
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-42",
  "customerSegment": "STANDARD",
  "lines": [{ "sku": "SKU-KEYBOARD", "quantity": 2 }, { "sku": "SKU-MOUSE", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Gold customer, 62,500 EUR: needs approval in Tasklist (http://localhost:8088/tasklist)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-gold",
  "customerSegment": "GOLD",
  "lines": [{ "sku": "SKU-SERVER", "quantity": 5 }]
}

### Sold-out product: rejected
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-7",
  "customerSegment": "STANDARD",
  "lines": [{ "sku": "SKU-SOLDOUT", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Order status (replace the id)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Pay (simulates the payment provider; goes through Kafka)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 217.00, "paymentId": "pay-001" }
